ady uses. 3.1.0 would be a major-version jump.\n- **Branch:** `fix/upgrade-fastjson-cve-2026-31337`, one commit changing `requirements.txt` only.\n- **CI:** run `ci-0001` on commit `c8b8ab7878` passed.\n- **PR:** #101 is open and awaiting review. Merging into main needs code-owner approval under policy, so I have not merged it.", "type": "text"}]}]}